{"seq":5,"slug":"influence-and-legacy","title":"亚里士多德·influence-and-legacy","stage":"DONE","category":"aristotle","categoryLabel":"亚里士多德","chapterCount":3,"docCount":6,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/aristotle/influence-and-legacy","rating":{"composite":3.72,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.4,"coverage":3.25,"positioning":4,"strategic":4.33},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"hubDir":"/Users/wangyang.learnwy/learnwy/learnwy/l-doc-hub/hubs/famous-people/23_aristotle/5_influence-and-legacy","introHtml":"<p>亚里士多德（前384—前322）的思想塑造了西方乃至世界两千多年的知识版图。但丁尊他为&quot;知者之师&quot;，中世纪学者径称其为&quot;那位哲学家&quot;。本部分追踪这份影响如何沿一条接力链传递：希腊逍遥学派保存文本→阿拉伯世界翻译注释并回流→阿奎那将其与基督教神学综合→近代科学在批判中诞生→当代德性伦理学复兴。</p>\n<h2 id=\"本-hub-与兄弟-hub-的分工\">本 hub 与兄弟 hub 的分工</h2><p>本 hub 只回答一个问题：亚里士多德的思想<strong>在他身后</strong>如何被传承、改造、挑战与复兴（&quot;影响史&quot;）。它不重复讲述其思想内容本身——那些属于兄弟 hub：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>思想的内容与方法：<a href=\"../ideas-and-methods/\">3_ideas-and-methods</a>（四因、德性、经验方法）</li>\n<li>著作本身：<a href=\"../major-works/\">4_major-works</a>（《工具论》《尼各马可伦理学》等）</li>\n<li>核心贡献：<a href=\"../core-contributions/\">2_core-contributions</a>（逻辑学的创立等）</li>\n<li>对其的争议与评价：<a href=\"../controversies-and-appraisal/\">6_controversies-and-appraisal</a>（科学错误、权威负担、总体评断）</li>\n<li>生平：<a href=\"../life-and-times/\">1_life-and-times</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p>凡涉及&quot;他主张了什么&quot;，本 hub 一律以相对链接指向上述兄弟 hub，不再展开；本 hub 专注&quot;这些主张后来怎么了&quot;。</p>\n<h2 id=\"推荐学习路径与前置\">推荐学习路径与前置</h2><p>建议先掌握其思想内容（至少读过 <a href=\"../ideas-and-methods/metaphysics/the-four-causes\">四因说</a> 与 <a href=\"../ideas-and-methods/ethics-of-virtue/happiness-and-the-good-life\">幸福与好生活</a>），再按时间顺序读本 hub：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><a href=\"the-master-of-those-who-know/philosophy-for-millennia\">影响千年的哲学</a> — 权威的规模与机制（总览）</li>\n<li><a href=\"the-master-of-those-who-know/the-aristotelian-tradition\">亚里士多德主义传统</a> — 整条传承链的骨架</li>\n<li><a href=\"the-medieval-synthesis/islamic-philosophy\">伊斯兰哲学</a> — 阿拉伯保存与回流</li>\n<li><a href=\"the-medieval-synthesis/aquinas-and-scholasticism\">阿奎那与经院哲学</a> — 中世纪综合（权威顶点）</li>\n<li><a href=\"enduring-legacy/the-birth-of-science\">科学的诞生</a> — 权威被反叛</li>\n<li><a href=\"enduring-legacy/aristotle-today\">今日的亚里士多德</a> — 当代复兴</li>\n</ol>\n<p>阅毕可转向 <a href=\"../controversies-and-appraisal/\">6_controversies-and-appraisal</a> 获得对其功过的均衡评断。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"the-master-of-those-who-know","title":"The Master Of Those Who Know","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/aristotle/influence-and-legacy/the-master-of-those-who-know","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"philosophy-for-millennia","title":"影响千年的哲学","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/aristotle/influence-and-legacy/the-master-of-those-who-know/philosophy-for-millennia"},{"seq":2,"slug":"the-aristotelian-tradition","title":"亚里士多德主义传统","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/aristotle/influence-and-legacy/the-master-of-those-who-know/the-aristotelian-tradition"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"the-medieval-synthesis","title":"The Medieval Synthesis","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/aristotle/influence-and-legacy/the-medieval-synthesis","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"islamic-philosophy","title":"伊斯兰哲学","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/aristotle/influence-and-legacy/the-medieval-synthesis/islamic-philosophy"},{"seq":2,"slug":"aquinas-and-scholasticism","title":"阿奎那与经院哲学","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/aristotle/influence-and-legacy/the-medieval-synthesis/aquinas-and-scholasticism"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"enduring-legacy","title":"Enduring Legacy","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/aristotle/influence-and-legacy/enduring-legacy","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"the-birth-of-science","title":"科学的诞生","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/aristotle/influence-and-legacy/enduring-legacy/the-birth-of-science"},{"seq":2,"slug":"aristotle-today","title":"今日的亚里士多德","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/aristotle/influence-and-legacy/enduring-legacy/aristotle-today"}]}]}